<p>But here's the thing — <strong>not all guards work for Madison's debris.</strong> Those cheap foam inserts from the hardware store? They fail within 18-24 months. Pine needles embed in the foam, water can't get through, and you're back to square one. We've pulled thousands of feet of failed foam guards out of <a href="/recent-projects/">Madison gutters</a>.</p>

